WEBVTT

00:27.205 --> 00:29.722
It's called a "gas weapon."

00:29.806 --> 00:33.322
The gas was made with
some of my spinal fluid.

00:33.406 --> 00:35.188
Inhaling even a small amount

00:35.272 --> 00:37.588
makes any Subjects of Ymir freeze up,

00:37.672 --> 00:42.321
lose control of their bodies,
and then fall unconscious.

00:42.405 --> 00:45.322
This also etches
a coordinate inside them.

00:45.406 --> 00:47.722
I use this path to send
the Power of the Titans

00:47.806 --> 00:49.703
to said coordinate.

00:51.406 --> 00:53.188
And that's why the people of that village

00:53.272 --> 00:55.588
transformed into obedient Titans.

00:55.672 --> 00:58.922
It was called "Ragako."
Not "that village."

00:59.005 --> 01:01.856
And seeing as you murdered
every person who lived there,

01:01.939 --> 01:04.522
you should learn the name,
you bearded shit.

01:04.606 --> 01:07.722
Look. It's not like
I wanted to do it.

01:07.806 --> 01:10.788
I just did what was needed
to convince the Marleyans

01:10.872 --> 01:12.322
that I was loyal to them.

01:12.406 --> 01:13.255
If they'd learned the truth,

01:13.339 --> 01:16.322
I never could've brought
hope to this island.

01:16.406 --> 01:17.588
None of this is new to you, though.

01:17.672 --> 01:21.388
I told you guys the exact same
thing when I first got here.

01:21.472 --> 01:23.921
Why do you keep asking me about it?

01:24.005 --> 01:25.856
Because I can see that
you aren't burdened

01:25.939 --> 01:28.856
by a shred of guilt
over what you've done.

01:28.939 --> 01:32.121
I still can't tell if you
actually wanna save Eldia,

01:32.205 --> 01:35.722
but it's clear that those lives
meant nothing to you.

01:35.806 --> 01:38.255
Doubt you were well-liked by the ladies.

01:38.339 --> 01:39.656
Considering how you think you know

01:39.740 --> 01:42.322
what everyone else is feeling.

01:42.406 --> 01:47.322
I do know. And I
was liked enough. So...

01:47.406 --> 01:48.788
Well good for you!

01:48.872 --> 01:50.788
Anyway, when are you
gonna let me meet with Eren

01:50.872 --> 01:53.322
so we can run our experiment?

01:53.406 --> 01:55.388
That isn't my call to make.

01:55.472 --> 01:57.322
We're waiting for HQ.

01:57.406 --> 02:00.255
If your commanders think
that they have time to spare,

02:00.339 --> 02:01.921
then they couldn't be more wrong.

02:02.005 --> 02:03.921
On that one point, we agree.

02:04.005 --> 02:05.503
Captain Levi!

02:07.406 --> 02:09.803
What? Are you serious?

03:47.059 --> 03:48.910
This building's so big!

03:48.994 --> 03:50.910
I've never seen anything like it!

03:50.994 --> 03:52.109
Neither have I!

03:52.193 --> 03:54.109
It must be your lucky day.

03:54.193 --> 03:56.709
Y'all ready for some fancy dinin'?

03:56.793 --> 03:57.842
Yeah!

03:57.926 --> 04:00.642
What's the matter, Mia?
You got the jitters?

04:00.726 --> 04:02.842
Uh. No, I'm fine. Thanks.

04:02.926 --> 04:04.709
All this fancy stuff make you nervous?

04:04.793 --> 04:06.041
I knew you were country kids,

04:06.125 --> 04:07.576
but I didn't know it was this bad.

04:07.660 --> 04:09.642
No. I... Kaya.

04:09.726 --> 04:11.776
Is there actually
a Marleyan prisoner of war

04:11.860 --> 04:13.041
working at this place?

04:13.125 --> 04:15.710
Yeah, he's here for sure, so get a grip.

04:15.794 --> 04:17.976
And watch out 'cause
soldiers eat here, too.

04:18.059 --> 04:20.442
Even if this prisoner
can't help us get out,

04:20.526 --> 04:21.957
he'll be good to know.

04:23.059 --> 04:26.576
Mr. Braus! I'm glad that
you were able to come.

04:26.660 --> 04:29.590
So am I. Thanks for
the invitation.

04:33.059 --> 04:35.776
Wow. Look at all these kids.

04:35.860 --> 04:37.776
You brought quite the crowd with you.

04:37.860 --> 04:39.910
Figured I might as well
bring the whole family.

04:39.994 --> 04:42.976
You did say it was "on the
house." Right, Nicolo?

04:43.059 --> 04:45.842
Yes. All of you are
welcome here.

04:45.926 --> 04:46.910
Come. This way.

04:46.994 --> 04:49.657
I'm really hungry, dad!

04:50.660 --> 04:54.842
That chef named Nicolo is the
Marleyan who invited us here.

04:54.926 --> 04:57.041
See if he can help you.

04:57.125 --> 04:59.776
Why was someone like Mr. Braus
invited to eat here anyway?

04:59.860 --> 05:01.642
I mean he's not a soldier.

05:01.726 --> 05:05.576
The Braus's eldest was the girl
who saved me from a Titan.

05:05.660 --> 05:08.041
They met Nicolo at her grave,
and got to talking.

05:08.125 --> 05:10.442
She loved his cooking,
so he offered to treat them

05:10.526 --> 05:12.776
to the meal he'll never get to make her.

05:12.860 --> 05:15.442
He didn't say this, but personally,

05:15.526 --> 05:16.923
I think they were in love.

05:21.526 --> 05:23.776
Ben? What's the matter?

05:23.860 --> 05:25.442
You got a stomach bug or somethin'?

05:25.526 --> 05:27.324
No. I'm fine.

05:30.993 --> 05:35.023
Delicious! I've never had a meal
this good in my whole life!

05:37.460 --> 05:38.442
Well, if you like that,

05:38.526 --> 05:41.390
then just wait till
you get to the main dish!

05:43.126 --> 05:45.376
Nicolo, you've got more guests.

05:45.460 --> 05:47.824
Huh? Who's here at this hour?

05:48.993 --> 05:50.923
The Scout Regiment.

05:51.660 --> 05:55.776
Hello there. This urgent?
Sorry, but...

05:55.860 --> 05:56.910
I'm preparing a main course for

05:56.993 --> 05:58.910
some very important guests right now.

05:58.993 --> 06:00.842
That's fine. If you're
in the middle of something,

06:00.925 --> 06:02.175
you can get back to it.

06:02.259 --> 06:04.776
But, we'd like to have
a quick word with you

06:04.860 --> 06:06.576
once you finish up.

06:06.660 --> 06:09.576
You wanna talk?
What is this about?

06:09.660 --> 06:12.842
We wondered if you might
have some concerns.

06:12.925 --> 06:15.642
The scouts're investigating
our detainment.

06:15.726 --> 06:18.509
We were hoping you'd be able to help us.

06:18.593 --> 06:20.957
Yeah. No problem.

06:22.593 --> 06:24.842
I'll ask you to wait in
here until I can finish.

06:24.925 --> 06:27.776
Wow. This room is pretty fancy.

06:27.860 --> 06:30.576
I bet it's usually reserved for MPs.

06:30.660 --> 06:33.376
Hey. I've heard
a whole lotta talk

06:33.460 --> 06:36.376
about this wine. It's so
nice that it's only served

06:36.460 --> 06:38.442
to high-ranking members of the military.

06:38.526 --> 06:39.642
Oh yeah?

06:39.726 --> 06:41.710
Well, aren't we high-ranking
members of the Scouts?

06:41.794 --> 06:42.842
Sure are!

06:42.925 --> 06:45.442
I'd say we've earned
a quick sip of liquid luxury.

06:45.526 --> 06:46.442
Let's have a little...

06:46.526 --> 06:48.023
Don't touch that!

06:50.259 --> 06:52.042
Whoa, calm down, man.

06:52.126 --> 06:54.509
We were just screwing around, so relax.

06:54.593 --> 06:56.857
No need to make a big thing of it.

06:57.925 --> 07:00.975
A wine of this quality would be
wasted on Eldians, understand?

07:01.059 --> 07:03.109
- -What?
- -What's with you?

07:03.193 --> 07:05.776
I can't believe you're
still spouting that crap.

07:05.859 --> 07:06.975
Regardless of what you've been told,

07:07.059 --> 07:08.975
your wine doesn't care what race we are!

07:09.059 --> 07:11.642
Get your hands off me, Eldian.

07:11.726 --> 07:15.509
I've been civil to you, but that
doesn't make us friends.

07:15.593 --> 07:17.843
It sounds to me like you've
forgotten your place here.

07:17.926 --> 07:18.975
On this island, you're just...

07:19.059 --> 07:21.642
Just a filthy POW?

07:21.726 --> 07:24.490
Guess that makes us even,
you Eldian devil.

07:28.660 --> 07:30.576
What is that guy's problem?

07:30.660 --> 07:33.524
Hell if I know. Whatever!

07:39.393 --> 07:40.776
'Kay. Now. Go for it!

07:40.859 --> 07:42.975
My stomach hurts real bad!

07:43.059 --> 07:44.376
Is there some way we can help?

07:44.460 --> 07:46.576
Don't tell me it's
'cause of something you ate.

07:46.660 --> 07:48.975
I should be okay, but I'm
gonna go to the restroom.

07:49.059 --> 07:50.109
I'll go with him.

07:50.193 --> 07:52.576
Just in case something goes
wrong while he's in there.

07:52.660 --> 07:53.857
Good luck.

08:02.726 --> 08:06.442
Hey, uh. The restroom
is the other way.

08:06.526 --> 08:08.710
That's not what we're here for, Nicolo.

08:08.793 --> 08:10.975
We're warrior candidates from Marley.

08:11.059 --> 08:13.042
And we're in hiding right now.

08:13.126 --> 08:14.242
Huh?

08:14.326 --> 08:15.309
We have reason to
believe that this island

08:15.393 --> 08:18.042
is about to be invaded by
an allied army made up of

08:18.126 --> 08:19.841
every major country in the world.

08:19.925 --> 08:22.042
Until that army comes,
just hang in there!

08:22.126 --> 08:24.442
And also, spread the word
to any other Marleyan

08:24.526 --> 08:25.841
captives you know!

08:25.925 --> 08:27.841
Wait. Take it back a few steps.

08:27.925 --> 08:29.576
How'd a pair of Warrior
Candidates like you

08:29.660 --> 08:30.642
even get here?

08:30.726 --> 08:33.841
These island devils raided
Liberio about a month ago.

08:33.925 --> 08:35.442
This might be hard to believe,

08:35.526 --> 08:37.376
but we actually fought
our way onto the airship

08:37.460 --> 08:40.390
they used to retreat
and got taken prisoner.

08:42.260 --> 08:46.042
Did you kill anyone?

08:46.126 --> 08:49.457
A female... soldier?

08:50.926 --> 08:52.576
Yeah. I brought her down!

08:52.660 --> 08:55.442
I've only rid the world of
a few devils so far.

08:55.526 --> 08:56.775
But I give you my word.

08:56.859 --> 08:58.842
Our real revenge hasn't even started yet!

08:58.926 --> 09:00.642
Help's coming. And when
the army gets here...

09:00.726 --> 09:02.576
Hey. Stop!

09:02.660 --> 09:03.376
What is it?

09:03.460 --> 09:07.523
It was you. You killed her.

09:08.526 --> 09:10.923
You're the little wretch
who murdered Sasha!

09:22.725 --> 09:27.842
Falco? Hey. Falco!

09:27.926 --> 09:30.576
Falco. Are you okay?

09:30.660 --> 09:32.510
Falco. Falco!

09:32.594 --> 09:34.975
Get up! Hey! Wake up!

09:35.059 --> 09:37.042
Shit. Shit!

09:37.126 --> 09:38.424
Falco!

09:43.926 --> 09:48.842
Wha... Nicolo! What're you
doin' to Ben and Mia?

09:48.926 --> 09:52.042
"Mia" here's been
keeping secrets from you.

09:52.126 --> 09:54.990
One being that she was
the one who murdered Sasha.

09:57.460 --> 09:58.842
She may be a kid,

09:58.926 --> 10:01.576
but she's also a trained
Marleyan soldier.

10:01.660 --> 10:04.442
She climbed aboard the Scout's
airship as it left Marley

10:04.526 --> 10:06.642
and shot Sasha in cold blood.

10:06.725 --> 10:08.642
She's the reason your daughter's gone.

10:08.725 --> 10:10.990
Your daughter?

10:14.126 --> 10:16.709
Take it, Mr. Braus. Go ahead.

10:16.793 --> 10:18.042
If you can't bring yourself to kill her,

10:18.126 --> 10:19.842
then I can do it for you.

10:19.926 --> 10:21.923
As the father, it's your call.

10:27.526 --> 10:28.976
Wha... What's going on in here?

10:29.060 --> 10:30.842
Everybody hurry over!

10:30.926 --> 10:33.057
Huh? What is it?

10:34.059 --> 10:36.442
That's the kid who shot Sasha!

10:36.526 --> 10:38.176
I heard she was on the run,

10:38.260 --> 10:40.641
but I'm surprised you recognized her.

10:40.725 --> 10:43.176
Wait, what are you planning to do here?

10:43.260 --> 10:45.442
Stay away from me! You hear?

10:45.526 --> 10:47.042
I'm just going to avenge Sasha.

10:47.126 --> 10:48.757
That's all I want!

10:51.260 --> 10:54.842
Stop. Leave Falco
out of this, please!

10:54.926 --> 10:57.176
What, is this brat
someone special to you?

10:57.260 --> 10:59.775
Is that why he tried
to protect you earlier?

10:59.859 --> 11:01.376
You care about him, huh?

11:01.460 --> 11:03.510
Well, I used to care about someone, too!

11:03.594 --> 11:06.576
A dirt-blooded Eldian!
A descendant of devils!

11:06.659 --> 11:07.976
A woman who enjoyed the food I cooked

11:08.060 --> 11:11.109
more than anyone I'd ever met before!

11:11.193 --> 11:14.842
She saved me from this
shitty-ass, pointless war!

11:14.926 --> 11:16.842
She showed me that
the person I'm meant to be

11:16.926 --> 11:19.975
is a man who brings people
happiness through his cooking.

11:20.059 --> 11:21.775
Her name was Sasha Braus.

11:21.859 --> 11:23.042
She was amazing.

11:23.126 --> 11:25.976
And you stole her from me!

11:26.060 --> 11:27.775
I've lost people, too.

11:27.859 --> 11:30.442
Your Sasha Braus
shot two friends of mine!

11:30.526 --> 11:32.775
She gunned them both down as
they were protecting their home!

11:32.859 --> 11:34.976
That's why I took revenge on her!

11:35.060 --> 11:36.641
She's the one who started it!

11:36.725 --> 11:39.842
Shut the hell up!
Who cares how it started?

11:39.926 --> 11:41.442
Wake up! Open your eyes!

11:41.526 --> 11:43.842
You're supposed to be a Marleyan soldier!

11:43.926 --> 11:46.442
That she-devil must've
bewitched you somehow.

11:46.526 --> 11:49.391
Fight! Don't let the devils win!

11:50.394 --> 11:53.656
All right, Nicolo.
Gimme that knife.

11:58.726 --> 12:00.291
Please.

12:20.726 --> 12:23.042
Listen, Mr. Braus.
This isn't right.

12:23.126 --> 12:24.775
Please drop the knife.

12:24.859 --> 12:27.642
Or maybe just set it down.

12:27.726 --> 12:30.442
I raised Sasha to be self-sufficient.

12:30.526 --> 12:31.842
Uh. What?

12:31.926 --> 12:34.442
I taught her how to use a bow
when she was young,

12:34.526 --> 12:35.842
and before long, she got good enough

12:35.926 --> 12:37.575
to hunt for food in our forest.

12:37.659 --> 12:41.376
It was our way of life, and we
didn't ever wanna give it up.

12:41.460 --> 12:43.976
But after Maria fell, I knew we'd have to

12:44.060 --> 12:47.042
change with the times
or die with the old ways,

12:47.126 --> 12:50.442
so I sent Sasha to join civilization.

12:50.525 --> 12:53.442
Then, the world just kept gettin' bigger.

12:53.525 --> 12:56.042
Sasha left our forest
and our island behind,

12:56.126 --> 12:57.909
to fight some distant enemy.

12:57.993 --> 13:00.642
To shoot folks and get shot.

13:00.726 --> 13:04.442
Thing is. She left our forest,

13:04.525 --> 13:06.909
but it turns out she just
traded it for a bigger one,

13:06.993 --> 13:10.575
where the same rule of "kill
or be killed" still applied.

13:10.659 --> 13:12.909
I reckon Sasha died

13:12.993 --> 13:16.442
'cause she wandered in
that forest for too long.

13:16.525 --> 13:19.042
We've gotta get the children
outta that forest

13:19.126 --> 13:20.976
at the very least.

13:21.060 --> 13:22.976
Or else there's nothing gonna stop this

13:23.060 --> 13:26.776
from happenin' again and again.

13:26.860 --> 13:28.109
Way I see it,

13:28.193 --> 13:31.042
when it comes to shouldering the
sins and hatreds of the past,

13:31.126 --> 13:34.642
that burden should fall to
adults like you and me.

13:34.726 --> 13:37.857
Please, Nicolo. We need
you to let Ben go now.

13:45.926 --> 13:48.842
Good. Okay.
Slow and steady does it, Lisa.

13:48.926 --> 13:49.976
Right.

13:50.060 --> 13:51.642
Show me your wounds.

13:51.726 --> 13:55.575
Mia. You're okay, aren't you?

13:55.659 --> 13:58.442
I-I don't understand.

13:58.525 --> 14:00.757
Do you really not hate me?

14:10.859 --> 14:11.976
Kaya...

14:12.060 --> 14:16.430
 Kaya stop, calm down, please.

14:12.060 --> 14:14.976
Murderer! You killed my sister!
How dare you say my name!

14:15.060 --> 14:17.575
I thought you were
my friend! How could you?!

14:17.659 --> 14:19.590
I think we should go. Come on.

14:34.260 --> 14:37.291
The main dish must've gone cold by now.

14:39.260 --> 14:43.842
Hange. You should rinse out
that kid's mouth out with water.

14:43.926 --> 14:45.642
Some of the wine got into it.

14:45.726 --> 14:46.976
Huh?

14:47.060 --> 14:49.842
Although...
It's probably too late.

14:49.926 --> 14:52.709
Why do you say that?

14:52.793 --> 14:54.857
What's in the wine?

14:55.459 --> 14:59.557
I think... it's
Zeke's spinal fluid.

15:09.592 --> 15:12.042
Zachary was assassinated?

15:12.126 --> 15:14.576
That's correct.
The Jaegerists effectively

15:14.660 --> 15:18.043
control everything inside the walls now.

15:18.127 --> 15:19.309
We believe that all this chaos

15:19.392 --> 15:22.109
is being caused by Zeke,
through a plan that he's been

15:22.193 --> 15:25.508
using Eren and Yelena to implement.

15:25.592 --> 15:26.576
What now?

15:26.660 --> 15:29.109
Not sure, but the way
the winds are blowing right now,

15:29.193 --> 15:30.976
I think Eren will be
brought to Zeke soon,

15:31.060 --> 15:33.043
just as the Jaegerists
have been demanding.

15:33.127 --> 15:36.442
What about Pyxis?
He's just rolling over?

15:36.526 --> 15:37.576
He remains steadfast.

15:37.660 --> 15:41.642
He plans to make his move
while Eren's being led here.

15:41.726 --> 15:45.043
And this plan involves
having somebody eat Eren, right?

15:45.127 --> 15:48.109
We're gonna kill him ourselves.

15:48.193 --> 15:49.642
That's right.

15:49.726 --> 15:50.690
Tch.

15:51.926 --> 15:54.842
I've saved Eren, again and again,

15:54.926 --> 15:58.109
watching more of my
comrades die every time.

15:58.193 --> 16:00.442
I did that because I believed

16:00.526 --> 16:03.442
he was the best hope humanity had.

16:03.526 --> 16:04.909
And this.

16:04.993 --> 16:07.576
This is where that belief has gotten me.

16:07.660 --> 16:10.708
It's like I'm at the punchline
of some awful joke.

16:10.792 --> 16:13.690
What the hell became of
the hope we all looked towards?

16:15.860 --> 16:18.909
All that struggle.
All that death.

16:18.993 --> 16:20.723
For this farce.

16:21.326 --> 16:24.642
Such bullshit.
It's not even funny.

16:24.726 --> 16:26.508
The piece of shit
we need to feed to a Titan

16:26.592 --> 16:27.857
is right beneath us.

16:30.526 --> 16:31.709
What did you just say?

16:31.793 --> 16:34.909
Why the hell would Zeke Jaeger's
spinal fluid be in the wine?

16:34.993 --> 16:38.709
I don't actually
have proof. But still.

16:38.793 --> 16:42.109
They packed the first survey
fleet to the brim with it.

16:42.193 --> 16:43.109
There's no way they'd've needed

16:43.193 --> 16:46.257
that much alcohol for a scouting mission.

16:47.127 --> 16:48.243
Again.

16:48.326 --> 16:50.709
And. Just as I was
starting to settle into

16:50.793 --> 16:53.909
my new job here as a chef,
I received instructions.

16:53.993 --> 16:56.709
In short, I was ordered to start
serving that Marleyan wine

16:56.793 --> 16:58.909
to high-ranking military officers.

16:58.993 --> 17:00.590
Who ordered it?

17:02.526 --> 17:04.709
It was Yelena.

17:04.793 --> 17:08.576
As far as I know, she's the
only one who was in on it.

17:08.660 --> 17:11.842
I can't speak for the other volunteers.

17:11.926 --> 17:14.709
No. I... I didn't know
about any of this.

17:14.793 --> 17:16.109
I give you my word.

17:16.193 --> 17:17.976
This doesn't make sense though!

17:18.060 --> 17:20.709
When Zeke's spinal fluid
is ingested by an Eldian,

17:20.793 --> 17:21.909
they're supposed to freeze up.

17:21.993 --> 17:24.043
That's only what we were told by Zeke.

17:24.127 --> 17:26.709
None of us have ever seen
how it happens in person.

17:26.793 --> 17:28.508
And there was no proof.

17:28.592 --> 17:29.842
But we bought it.

17:29.926 --> 17:34.308
It seems like such a small lie,
but it's had an enormous effect.

17:34.392 --> 17:37.308
We thought Zeke's spinal
fluid caused paralysis,

17:37.392 --> 17:38.976
so when the wine caused no symptoms,

17:39.060 --> 17:40.909
we assumed it was safe.

17:40.993 --> 17:43.642
Yeah, but wait. Nicolo.

17:43.726 --> 17:45.909
You don't actually know
that it's dosed, right?

17:45.993 --> 17:48.376
No. Not for a fact.

17:48.460 --> 17:51.508
That said, I do know that in the past,

17:51.592 --> 17:53.709
Zeke's spinal fluid has been
used in similar ways,

17:53.793 --> 17:55.657
to tremendous effect.

17:56.660 --> 17:58.776
Ten years ago, Marley conquered

17:58.860 --> 18:01.709
a hostile nation's capital overnight.

18:01.793 --> 18:03.576
This was made possible
by the sudden appearance

18:03.660 --> 18:06.909
of hundreds of Titans in the city.

18:06.993 --> 18:09.509
She must plan to use the same trick here.

18:09.593 --> 18:11.109
Why else would she
order me to make sure that

18:11.192 --> 18:14.576
your military's top officers
drank that suspicious wine?

18:14.660 --> 18:16.909
No other explanation makes sense.

18:16.993 --> 18:19.043
If that's true, then when you snatched

18:19.127 --> 18:22.909
that bottle from me earlier,
you were trying to protect us.

18:22.993 --> 18:27.457
No. I have no idea
what I'm doing.

18:28.192 --> 18:29.709
I came here to help save the world

18:29.793 --> 18:32.308
from the devils on this island.

18:32.392 --> 18:33.709
Now that I've told you all of this,

18:33.793 --> 18:36.909
I'm sure that my days must be numbered.

18:36.993 --> 18:39.509
Sorry, Mr. Braus.

18:39.593 --> 18:42.308
I can't be as forgiving as you are,

18:42.392 --> 18:45.909
but I do want to atone in some small way.

18:45.993 --> 18:48.709
I was about to murder a child.

18:48.793 --> 18:50.376
How screwed up can I be?

18:50.460 --> 18:53.590
I... I just... I...

18:54.860 --> 18:56.690
Oh, Nicolo.

19:00.592 --> 19:03.709
Tell me. Why did you save me?

19:03.793 --> 19:07.508
Don't know. Guess I really
didn't have a reason.

19:07.592 --> 19:11.109
I'm the one who killed
your comrades on that airship.

19:11.192 --> 19:14.909
I'm the one who crushed that
guard's skull with a brick.

19:14.993 --> 19:17.043
Falco didn't do anything.

19:17.126 --> 19:20.509
So kill me, not him. Okay?

19:20.593 --> 19:22.376
We won't kill you.

19:22.460 --> 19:25.109
Why not?
I know you must want to.

19:25.192 --> 19:28.442
Why would I want that?

19:28.526 --> 19:29.709
Always with the killing.

19:29.793 --> 19:31.909
It's like it's all you ever think about.

19:31.993 --> 19:34.557
Just like someone else I know.

19:37.526 --> 19:38.557
Er...

19:42.993 --> 19:44.576
Is something wrong?

19:44.660 --> 19:45.909
There you are, Commander.

19:45.993 --> 19:47.709
What's going on?

19:47.793 --> 19:50.108
I'm glad you showed up.

19:50.192 --> 19:52.709
If anyone knows where
Zeke's being held, it's you.

19:52.793 --> 19:54.043
You'll have to drop
whatever it is you're doing

19:54.126 --> 19:55.108
and take us to him.

19:55.192 --> 19:57.509
Wait. We have no intention
of fighting you.

19:57.593 --> 19:59.509
Didn't you get the military's proposal?

19:59.593 --> 20:02.108
We did, and we promptly rejected it.

20:02.192 --> 20:04.509
We refuse to negotiate
with your military.

20:04.593 --> 20:08.108
I see. And why is that?

20:08.192 --> 20:10.376
The decision came from Eren.

20:10.460 --> 20:12.509
He knew that Commander
Pyxis would never leave

20:12.593 --> 20:15.909
the fate of the island
in our hands willingly.

20:15.993 --> 20:17.709
And I agree.

20:17.793 --> 20:19.909
I'm sure that Pyxis is
frantically devising a plan

20:19.993 --> 20:23.509
to ambush Eren and steal the
Founder, even as we speak.

20:23.593 --> 20:25.709
You have quite the imagination.

20:25.793 --> 20:27.509
Or did this come from one of your sources

20:27.593 --> 20:28.976
in the Garrison Regiment?

20:29.059 --> 20:31.509
You have comrades
undercover there, don't you?

20:31.593 --> 20:33.509
Do I look like one of your eager lackeys

20:33.593 --> 20:35.709
who's gonna answer
any question that you ask?

20:35.793 --> 20:36.776
Get moving.

20:36.860 --> 20:38.442
I'm willing to prove that
I don't answer to you,

20:38.526 --> 20:40.042
if it comes down to it,

20:40.126 --> 20:42.843
but I'm hoping that you'll
just come along quietly.

20:42.927 --> 20:43.909
Damn it.

20:43.993 --> 20:45.909
How the hell did they know
to look for us here?

20:45.993 --> 20:48.108
Greiz?

20:48.192 --> 20:49.642
Don't tell me you brought them.

20:49.726 --> 20:51.709
Did Yelena put you up to this?

20:51.793 --> 20:52.909
Nicolo.

20:52.993 --> 20:55.909
You've become far too attached
to this group of Eldians.

20:55.993 --> 20:58.909
I knew that you and I would
stand opposed eventually.

20:58.993 --> 21:00.509
I was right not to tell you how to

21:00.593 --> 21:02.643
contact the Scouts when you asked.

21:02.727 --> 21:06.308
Floch, listen!
We can't afford to waste time

21:06.392 --> 21:08.108
fighting amongst ourselves right now!

21:08.192 --> 21:10.108
Wine that's been tainted
with Zeke's spinal fluid

21:10.192 --> 21:12.509
has been disseminated
throughout the military!

21:12.593 --> 21:15.042
Zeke has us dancing
in the palm of his hand!

21:15.126 --> 21:16.308
We have to stop him!

21:16.392 --> 21:17.642
Actually, we don't.

21:17.726 --> 21:22.576
Sounds like those idiot MPs are
gonna become even bigger idiots.

21:22.660 --> 21:23.843
Now let's get moving.

21:23.927 --> 21:28.509
I never said that the MPs drank it.

21:28.593 --> 21:30.309
You're kidding. You knew?

21:30.393 --> 21:32.857
You let them drink that poison?

21:36.192 --> 21:39.590
Keep it down, will ya?
This is a family restaurant.

21:45.192 --> 21:46.509
We're gonna go on ahead.

21:46.593 --> 21:47.975
Good.

21:48.059 --> 21:49.709
That was Floch.

21:49.793 --> 21:51.857
So you brought him here with you, then?

21:52.860 --> 21:54.324
Yeah.

22:03.060 --> 22:07.023
I wanted to talk with you two.

23:41.438 --> 23:43.220
As his supporters take Hange

23:43.304 --> 23:44.621
and the others captive,

23:44.704 --> 23:48.686
Eren stares intensely
at Armin and Mikasa.

23:48.770 --> 23:51.686
He wants to talk.

23:51.770 --> 23:54.768
Next episode: "Savagery."
